</narrative><display x="15" y="-240" w="180" h="60" /></stage><stage stageid="f8c86b2b-fa64-4846-89c0-6632ab0966e5" name="Start" type="Start"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="330" y="-255" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Exception Type" narrative="Exception Type : Ex: SYSTEM EXCEPTION" stage="txt_Exception Type" /></inputs><onsuccess>f62c8a39-07e9-4fb0-ae4d-7357d4bdcf9a</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="f098f3ce-f77e-4094-835f-ad8ba80b60a5" name="End" type="End"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="240" y="45" /></stage><stage stageid="f62c8a39-07e9-4fb0-ae4d-7357d4bdcf9a" name="Split Completed Wo Outcome Rules" type="Action"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="330" y="-195" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Text to Split" friendlyname="Text to Split" narrative="The text to split" expr="[coll_ConfigFileData.Completed_without_outcome_msgs]" /><input type="text" name="Split Char" friendlyname="Split Char" narrative="The split delimiter" expr="&quot;,&quot;" /><input type="text" name="Collection Field Name" friendlyname="Collection Field Name" narrative="The name of the field for the resulting collection" expr="&quot;Exception&quot;" /></inputs><outputs><output type="collection" name="Split Values" friendlyname="Split Values" narrative="The resulting collection containing the split values" stage="coll_Exceptions" /></outputs><onsuccess>e6f5d353-fbd6-4d11-a5d4-803d095c7445</onsuccess><resource object="Utility - Strings" action="Split Text" /></stage><stage stageid="18c84148-c514-4f7c-814c-e6b5098782fb" name="Check If Rule Is Found" type="Action"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="330" y="-75" /><inputs><input type="collection" name="Collection" friendlyname="Collection" narrative="Required : The collection to search" expr="[coll_Exceptions]" /><input type="text" name="Column Name" friendlyname="Column Name" narrative="Required : The name of the column to search" expr="&quot;Exception&quot;" /><input type="text" name="Exact Value" friendlyname="Exact Value" narrative="Optional : The exact value to search for - this is case insensitive" expr="[txt_Exception Detail]" /><input type="text" name="Regex" friendlyname="Regex" narrative="Optional : The regular expression to search for - this is case sensitive unless specified otherwise in the regular expression using &quot;(?i)&quot;" expr="" /></inputs><outputs><output type="flag" name="Contains Search Term" friendlyname="Contains Search Term" narrative="Flag indicating if the collection found the given search term or not" stage="flg_Contains Search Term" /><output type="collection" name="Groups" friendlyname="Groups" narrative="The groups defined in the regular expression when it is applied to the found term" stage="" /></outputs><onsuccess>a538e3c6-950f-4978-aa05-ac8613318db1</onsuccess><resource object="Utility - Collection Manipulation_Extended" action="Collection Contains Value" /></stage><stage stageid="e6fdc993-59ab-4f9d-93fb-b5ef0c2d4b2b" name="flg_Contains Search Term" type="Data"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="15" y="-135" w="180" h="30" /><datatype>flag</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="a538e3c6-950f-4978-aa05-ac8613318db1" name="Completed Without Outcome" type="Decision"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="330" y="-15" /><decision expression="[flg_Contains Search Term]" /><ontrue>118907f1-27ab-46fc-b7ea-c869bb935abf</ontrue><onfalse>0165b990-be82-40cb-8f14-d2f1a6bf4181</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="118907f1-27ab-46fc-b7ea-c869bb935abf" name="Set Status" type="Action"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>Updates the status field for the item. The status field can be used to flag what has been done in a process so far. If a process encounters an exception, this information can be used to skip to the parts of the process not yet done for the item next time it is worked. The item must be 'owned' by the calling process - i.e. it must have been retrieved using Get Next Item.

This action will also reset the Attempts column to zero, because if the status updated the process should have successfully done something.</narrative><display x="240" y="-15" /><font family="Tahoma" size="10" style="Regular" color="000000" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Item ID" narrative="The ID of the item to mark" expr="[txt_Item ID]" /><input type="text" name="Status" narrative="The new status - 255 characters maximum." expr="&quot;COMPLETED WITHOUT OUTCOME&quot;" /></inputs><onsuccess>f098f3ce-f77e-4094-835f-ad8ba80b60a5</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsWorkQueuesActions" action="Update Status" /></stage><stage stageid="0165b990-be82-40cb-8f14-d2f1a6bf4181" name="Set Status" type="Action"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>Updates the status field for the item. The status field can be used to flag what has been done in a process so far. If a process encounters an exception, this information can be used to skip to the parts of the process not yet done for the item next time it is worked. The item must be 'owned' by the calling process - i.e. it must have been retrieved using Get Next Item.

This action will also reset the Attempts column to zero, because if the status updated the process should have successfully done something.</narrative><display x="330" y="45" /><font family="Tahoma" size="10" style="Regular" color="000000" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Item ID" narrative="The ID of the item to mark" expr="[txt_Item ID]" /><input type="text" name="Status" narrative="The new status - 255 characters maximum." expr="[txt_Exception Type]" /></inputs><onsuccess>f098f3ce-f77e-4094-835f-ad8ba80b60a5</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsWorkQueuesActions" action="Update Status" /></stage><stage stageid="e87b5969-ae1b-47fc-8a8b-de66cc65031c" name="Variables" type="Block"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="-75" y="-195" w="180" h="75" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Regular" color="7FB2E5" /></stage><stage stageid="e03c2f23-0963-458e-ad9b-ba8719cf7eab" name="Completed without outcome" type="Decision"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="150" y="-15" /><decision expression="InStr([txt_Exception Detail],[coll_Exceptions.Exception])&gt;0" /><ontrue>118907f1-27ab-46fc-b7ea-c869bb935abf</ontrue><onfalse>bdbe370c-dffe-49cc-8c88-2b4d65661b22</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="8dfbe137-96c3-418a-bd53-8c45ff344b00" name="Exceptions" type="LoopStart"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="150" y="-75" /><onsuccess>e03c2f23-0963-458e-ad9b-ba8719cf7eab</onsuccess><groupid>a7408c0c-15f4-43a9-88f5-a06c9a0bd78c</groupid><looptype>ForEach</looptype><loopdata>coll_Exceptions</loopdata></stage><stage stageid="bdbe370c-dffe-49cc-8c88-2b4d65661b22" name="Exceptions" type="LoopEnd"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="150" y="45" /><onsuccess>61d4f58d-807d-4d69-8616-c48c965f7ada</onsuccess><groupid>a7408c0c-15f4-43a9-88f5-a06c9a0bd78c</groupid></stage><stage stageid="834ef886-1e02-40c6-8088-ecc347ad03c4" name="Aprox Match                      /                        Exact Match" type="Block"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="120" y="-225" w="330" h="285" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Regular" color="7FB2E5" /></stage><stage stageid="629e5e5b-2f96-40ef-a2ec-e395defb2e7b" name="Note10" type="Note"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>If the recieved Exception is not an exact match with the one present in the Config file, this logic can be used

After Split Text action, Link it to this Block
</narrative><display x="45" y="-15" w="90" h="150" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Bold" color="008000" /></stage><stage stageid="61d4f58d-807d-4d69-8616-c48c965f7ada" name="Anchor5" type="Anchor"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="150" y="105" w="10" h="10" /><onsuccess>84c7f9cd-61fb-4ce1-8c47-b875a5a3d0ff</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="84c7f9cd-61fb-4ce1-8c47-b875a5a3d0ff" name="Anchor6" type="Anchor"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="330" y="105" w="10" h="10" /><onsuccess>0165b990-be82-40cb-8f14-d2f1a6bf4181</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="030c8654-e223-4c1d-bf92-0c5514b51e70" name="Note12" type="Note"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>Storing 'Completed Without Outome' messages in Config file is the recommended approach.
If you want to use a different approach, please connect with the QA reviewer to explain your Strategy.</narrative><display x="675" y="-195" w="390" h="60" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Bold" color="008000" /><onsuccess>f62c8a39-07e9-4fb0-ae4d-7357d4bdcf9a</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="553fe857-4928-4ac7-888d-fe600f272081" name="Recover" type="Recover"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="420" y="45" /><onsuccess>cbc0ed2e-1b4c-44ca-ab18-a4c864a89f06</onsuccess><breakpoint type="0"><condition></condition></breakpoint></stage><stage stageid="cbc0ed2e-1b4c-44ca-ab18-a4c864a89f06" name="Resume" type="Resume"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit /><display x="510" y="45" /><onsuccess>2b88e9ea-5fc1-440f-9137-6406d0825a01</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="45c551bc-42c0-483f-929d-2cbb08736b7b" name="End8" type="End"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="510" y="165" /></stage><stage stageid="2b88e9ea-5fc1-440f-9137-6406d0825a01" name="Set Status" type="Action"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>Updates the status field for the item. The status field can be used to flag what has been done in a process so far. If a process encounters an exception, this information can be used to skip to the parts of the process not yet done for the item next time it is worked. The item must be 'owned' by the calling process - i.e. it must have been retrieved using Get Next Item.

This action will also reset the Attempts column to zero, because if the status updated the process should have successfully done something.</narrative><display x="510" y="105" /><font family="Tahoma" size="10" style="Regular" color="000000" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Item ID" narrative="The ID of the item to mark" expr="[txt_Item ID]" /><input type="text" name="Status" narrative="The new status - 255 characters maximum." expr="[txt_Exception Type]" /></inputs><onsuccess>45c551bc-42c0-483f-929d-2cbb08736b7b</onsuccess><resource object="Blueprism.Automate.clsWorkQueuesActions" action="Update Status" /></stage><stage stageid="c32496cc-d896-4410-9cae-3ae3b3db3182" name="Note12" type="Note"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><narrative>The list of Completed without Outcome Messages are stored in the Config file
We are checking if the obtained exception for the Current Item matches with the One in the list.
Please note that this logic needs an exact match </narrative><display x="675" y="-75" w="390" h="60" /><font family="Segoe UI" size="10" style="Bold" color="008000" /><onsuccess>18c84148-c514-4f7c-814c-e6b5098782fb</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="e6f5d353-fbd6-4d11-a5d4-803d095c7445" name="Exact Match Logic Followed" type="Decision"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="330" y="-135" /><decision expression="[flg_CompletedWithoutOutcomeExactMatchLogic]" /><ontrue>18c84148-c514-4f7c-814c-e6b5098782fb</ontrue><onfalse>0d16201a-06f8-4aad-96d7-40057f9da824</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="0d16201a-06f8-4aad-96d7-40057f9da824" name="Anchor2" type="Anchor"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="150" y="-135" w="10" h="10" /><onsuccess>8dfbe137-96c3-418a-bd53-8c45ff344b00</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="2dc44556-fe42-419a-b71d-404b7d0ae573" name="coll_Exceptions" type="Collection"><subsheetid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</subsheetid><display x="15" y="-165" w="180" h="30" /><datatype>collection</datatype><private /><alwaysinit /><collectioninfo><field name="Exception" type="text" /></collectioninfo></stage><stage stageid="fb9218b8-47bd-41d9-b469-7fa83e6c1c82" name="Completed No Outcome" type="SubSheet"><subsheetid>e5ead44f-6e56-4826-bf5f-5fc4eb9514ae</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="180" y="-165" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Exception Type" friendlyname="Exception Type" narrative="Exception Type : Ex: SYSTEM EXCEPTION" expr="&quot;BUSINESS EXCEPTION&quot;" /></inputs><onsuccess>eede900f-1532-4634-acec-77176369e1a4</onsuccess><processid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</processid></stage><stage stageid="e4c6e513-9d7c-4e99-9afb-c2a32d3dd9aa" name="Completed No Outcome" type="SubSheet"><subsheetid>e5ead44f-6e56-4826-bf5f-5fc4eb9514ae</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="15" y="-105" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Exception Type" friendlyname="Exception Type" narrative="Exception Type : Ex: SYSTEM EXCEPTION" expr="&quot;SYSTEM EXCEPTION&quot;" /></inputs><onsuccess>0ffa0fda-db26-41c1-b0dc-88bdee211494</onsuccess><processid>47a794f5-6ce4-42db-ab6a-f65834994e54</processid></stage><stage stageid="b4bdc964-d81c-4cc2-aaf0-1d41c2754bd5" name="flg_CompletedWithoutOutcomeExactMatchLogic" type="Data"><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="-360" y="1005" w="180" h="30" /><datatype>flag</datatype><initialvalue>True</initialvalue><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="36d8db06-83da-49db-b001-a380c2f43d0b" name="dt_Exception DateTime" type="Data"><display x="525" y="-30" /><datatype>datetime</datatype><initialvalue /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="2bcbd198-5afb-40e1-872b-f4985d80b974" name="Check Exception Date Time" type="Decision"><subsheetid>10679a12-816c-43cb-a248-1a6b157a7504</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="-150" y="-75" w="90" h="30" /><decision expression="IsDateTime([In_dt_ItemCompletedOn])" /><ontrue>7d7643e6-ae7f-4f2e-ad16-2fa82983e407</ontrue><onfalse>44668316-41c1-4c66-93aa-f2c38d52f5e9</onfalse></stage><stage stageid="44668316-41c1-4c66-93aa-f2c38d52f5e9" name="Send Data to Data Gateways" type="Action"><subsheetid>10679a12-816c-43cb-a248-1a6b157a7504</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><narrative>This action can be used to serialize and send a Blue Prism collection to the data gateway. 
    There is a limit of approximately ~4MB on the data that can be sent through this method. 
    This is due to limitations enforced by the JSON Serializer.</narrative><display x="-90" y="15" w="90" h="30" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Process Name" friendlyname="Process Name" narrative="Process Name" expr="[In_txt_Process Name]" /><input type="text" name="Item Id" friendlyname="Item Id" narrative="Unique id to investigate from Blue Prism database" expr="[In_txt_ItemId]" /><input type="text" name="Item Key" friendlyname="Item Key" narrative="Unique id to help business team connect to the transaction" expr="[In_txt_ItemKey]" /><input type="datetime" name="Input Data Received On" friendlyname="Input Data Received On" narrative="Time when input was available for the bot. Example Email reveived on, Input received from SAP etc." expr="[In_dt_InputDataReceivedOn]" /><input type="datetime" name="Item Created On" friendlyname="Item Created On" narrative="Time when item is loaded into the queue" expr="[In_dt_ItemCreatedOn]" /><input type="datetime" name="Item Completed On" friendlyname="Item Completed On" narrative="Completed time for the item. Helps calculate TAT" expr="Now()" /><input type="timespan" name="Total Work Time" friendlyname="Total Work Time" narrative="Handling time for the transaction" expr="[In_Total Work Time]" /><input type="text" name="Queue Item Status" friendlyname="Queue Item Status" narrative="COMPLETED, COMPLETED WITHOUT OUTCOME, SYSTEM EXCEPTION, BUSINESS EXCEPTION" expr="[In_txt_Queue Item Status]" /><input type="text" name="Final Outcome" friendlyname="Final Outcome" narrative="Applicable only in case of BUSINESS EXCEPTION, SYSTEM EXCEPTION or COMPLETED WITHOUT OUTCOME" expr="[In_txt_Final Outcome]" /><input type="text" name="Resource VM" friendlyname="Resource VM" narrative="Resource VM name" expr="GetResourceName()" /></inputs><onsuccess>d264c98c-a086-4678-97c5-cdfac720474c</onsuccess><resource object="Utility_DataGateways-CustomFramework" action="Send Data to Data Gateways" /></stage><stage stageid="2a42e8c7-c703-4980-bdcf-278c6f773522" name="Coll1" type="Collection"><subsheetid>b749d60a-bded-4d36-b099-3627ed699606</subsheetid><display x="-420" y="165" /><datatype>collection</datatype><private /><alwaysinit /></stage><stage stageid="b68bf3d6-78ad-4fb2-a63c-368f0be412c7" name="Calc1" type="Calculation"><subsheetid>2f279d9f-8a57-4c2a-b39c-8e8b9b42b2bf</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="240" y="45" /><onsuccess>8a2c8044-9d3d-461f-bce0-d58864753721</onsuccess><calculation expression="[pwd_API Header Key Value]" stage="Data1" /></stage><stage stageid="e8fd2c0c-52f2-4b65-b145-6a17b93a898f" name="Data1" type="Data"><subsheetid>2f279d9f-8a57-4c2a-b39c-8e8b9b42b2bf</subsheetid><loginhibit onsuccess="true" /><display x="-480" y="-90" /><datatype>text</datatype><initialvalue /><private /><alwaysinit /></stage></process></process>
        <process id="d615d7c3-c5d0-4b01-b056-5c24afd881a2" name="RPA_Sharepoint_API_ConfigFile_Download" published="true" xmlns="http://www.blueprism.co.uk/product/process"><process name="RPA_Sharepoint_API_ConfigFile_Download" version="1.0" bpversion="7.3.1.15031" narrative="Sharepoint API Utility to download config file from RPA Sharepoint Site" byrefcollection="true" processrunningmessage="" disableversioning="false"><view><camerax>123</camerax><cameray>-303</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view><preconditions><condition narrative="Sharepoint Folder should exist and and config file should be available in this folder." /></preconditions><endpoint narrative="Config file will be downloaded to specified download path." /><subsheet subsheetid="6565363c-2e10-4c0b-9ac9-992a20df8182" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Get Sharepoint Credentials</name><view><camerax>1</camerax><cameray>39</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="38d1af81-a59c-4021-ba37-b77a0ac447e1" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Get URL Components</name><view><camerax>-10</camerax><cameray>105</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="b08beb56-c9b4-424d-bb21-5e13a2f9c6d6" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Authenticate with Sharepoint Client ID</name><view><camerax>-170</camerax><cameray>-167</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="4e9d820e-05ae-431b-9274-f250e2e8d849" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Directory Exists</name><view><camerax>-43</camerax><cameray>118</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="28624cb7-7f33-4857-ba88-33aa31ce4220" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Download File</name><view><camerax>122</camerax><cameray>132</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="74d5ec64-5060-4bb4-b1e7-cf3f788792d2" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Get Azure Credentials</name><view><camerax>-64</camerax><cameray>-99</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><subsheet subsheetid="d73076f8-8f6b-489a-9677-0f6677875898" type="Normal" published="False"><name>Download File from Azure</name><view><camerax>-47</camerax><cameray>66</cameray><zoom version="2">1.25</zoom></view></subsheet><stage stageid="80ccfaae-e376-4da9-abb4-f4e98f09f959" name="Stage1" type="ProcessInfo"><display x="-570" y="-375" w="150" h="90" /></stage><stage stageid="5eabbd18-07e6-4451-9491-3608867ca420" name="Start" type="Start"><display x="105" y="-480" /><inputs><input type="text" name="Sharepoint Folder Path" narrative="Sharepoint folder path excluding domain name &lt;eg. &quot;/sites/AAFAA5234/RPA Release File/PID_022_DS_PEMEX/&quot; &gt;" stage="Sharepoint_Folder_Path" /><input type="text" name="Config File Name" narrative="Config File name with extension" stage="Config_File_Name" /><input type="text" name="VM Download Path" narrative="Path to save config file in VM &lt;eg. &quot;C\apps\&quot;" stage="VM_Download_Path" /></inputs><onsuccess>590f1b1b-8002-493a-b6f9-c421abd26051</onsuccess></stage><stage stageid="47e32a6c-925a-4294-9b34-20a232050962" name="Download File" type="SubSheetInfo"><subsheetid>28624cb7-7f33-4857-ba88-33aa31ce4220</subsheetid><narrative>Download the file from sharepoint by passing bearer token
