GetWorkbook(handle, "").BuiltinDocumentProperties(Property) = Value</narrative><display x="15" y="135" w="150" h="30" /><inputs><input type="number" name="handle" expr="[handle]" /><input type="text" name="Property" expr="[Property Name]" /><input type="text" name="Value" expr="[Value]" /><input type="date" name="date_test" expr="[Data1]" /><input type="text" name="workbook" expr="[Workbook]" /></inputs><onsuccess>7c92face-955a-4e89-a825-f571d01aeb0d</onsuccess><code><![CDATA[Dim excel,objWorkbook,strProperty As Object

excel = GetObject( , "Excel.Application")
